# Merge rules for harness files in team mode (see .agent/workflows/integrate.md).
# Drivers fire only when BOTH sides changed the file; one-sided changes merge normally.
# `union` is built into git: keep both sides' lines (right for append-mostly files).
# `ours` needs one-time activation per clone: `git config merge.ours.driver true`.
.agent/STATE.md merge=ours
.agent/BOARD.md merge=union
.agent/DECISIONS.md merge=union
.agent/journal/*.md merge=union
